BT /F1 10.0 Tf 72.00 287.00 Td (Each quantization group shares a scale and a zero point. We use a group size of 32 for both) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 72.00 274.00 Td (keys and values and asymmetric rounding to two bits:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 150.00 254.00 Td (Q\(x\) = round\(\(x - z\) / s\),  s = \(max - min\) / 3,  z = min           \(1\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 72.00 232.00 Td (Per-channel quantization of keys needs a group of tokens to be complete before it can be) Tj ET
