BT /F1 10.0 Tf 72.00 206.00 Td (in full precision and are quantized together once the buffer is full. Attention is computed) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 72.00 193.00 Td (over the quantized part and the residual part and the two results are combined.) Tj ET
